  {
    "id": 2231,
    "date": "2024-01-09T21:30:23+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "The main tree at my camp highlighted by the morning sun.  I believe it is a salt cedar, not sure.",
    "media": "2231.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 2232,
    "date": "2024-01-09T22:56:28+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "I can extend my arms and legs fully as a star, stretching out with a bit of float, touching each corner. \n\nIt is a perfect stretching and yoga tub, with continuous fresh hot water.\n\nThis is the smaller, cooling tub.\n\nWonderful place, you must visit someday if you can, but I prefer only at night, after curfew, when no one is there.",
    "media": "2232.jpg"
  },
