  {
    "id": 2242,
    "date": "2024-01-18T19:13:34+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "Soil sampling includes erratic clusters with unique cleavage properties, interesting under a microscope.",
    "media": "2242.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 2243,
    "date": "2024-01-28T03:15:49+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "Kitty has ridden about 100 kilometers already. She seems to get along just fine. Many people notice her head, especially women and children, who often make comment. I don't stop. Kitty has  never interacted with another human other than myself. Growing up outdoors in the wild, under my care, she is rather afraid of the outside world. The noise and everyone in motion makes her want to seek shelter in some safe corner.",
    "media": "2243.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 2244,
    "date": "2024-01-28T03:15:50+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "The BLM is installing a new fence with two gates. The fence will be higher and stronger. We have yet to see whether the gates will be locked during curfew hours.",
    "media": "2244.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 2245,
    "date": "2024-01-28T03:15:50+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "",
